OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to work with the underdog,
OL,4,Athe ones struggling to get
OL,5,Aopportunities'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhenever Michael Duna thought of the
OL,8,Ffuture as a teenager he could not see a
OL,9,Fclear path ahead.
OL,11,FA foster child since the age of two,
OL,12,FMichael felt "lost" and struggled in
OL,13,Fmainstream education, often getting
OL,14,Finto trouble at school or with the law.
OL,16,FWhen he got expelled at the age of 14
OL,17,Fhe was referred to Leeds-based Building
OL,18,FFutures Together, which supports young
OL,19,Fpeople at risk of dropping out of
OL,20,Feducation, employment or training -
OL,21,Fotherwise known as Neet.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
