OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to work with the underdog,
OL,4,Athe ones struggling to get
OL,5,Aopportunities'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was founded by former West Yorkshire
OL,8,FPolice officer John Thornton who was
OL,9,Finspired to help after working with
OL,10,Frepeat offenders at HMP Leeds.
